          {
            "code": "\tif value[\u0027action\u0027] \u003d\u003d \u0027edit\u0027:\n\t\tchkShtTypeInfo \u003d system.kanoa.utilities.convertDatasetRowToJSON(system.kanoa.quality.sheet.getSheetTypes({\u0027chkShtTypeId\u0027: value[\u0027chkShtTypeId\u0027] or -1}), 0)\n\n\telif value[\u0027action\u0027] \u003d\u003d \u0027add\u0027:\n\t\tparentInfo \u003d system.kanoa.utilities.convertDatasetRowToJSON(system.kanoa.quality.sheet.getSheetTypes({\u0027chkShtTypeId\u0027: value[\u0027chkShtTypeId\u0027] or -1}), 0)\n\t\tchkShtTypeInfo \u003d system.kanoa.utilities.convertDatasetRowToJSON(system.kanoa.quality.sheet.getSheetTypes({\u0027chkShtTypeId\u0027: -1}), 0)\n\t\t\n\t\tchkShtTypeInfo[\u0027path\u0027] \u003d parentInfo[\u0027path\u0027]\n\t\tchkShtTypeInfo[\u0027parentId\u0027] \u003d value[\u0027chkShtTypeId\u0027]\n\t\n\telse: return {}\n\t\n\tif chkShtTypeInfo[\u0027enabled\u0027] is None: chkShtTypeInfo[\u0027enabled\u0027] \u003d True\n\t\n\treturn chkShtTypeInfo\n\t\t\n\t",
            "type": "script"
          }
        ],
        "type": "property"
      },
      "persistent": true
    },
